  triage:closedNote "INDEPENDENT VERIFICATION (quality-mgr, 3b22fe25dd1efcf5bdb2921709f8c169ff17c0d0, PR #838): .just/lint_boundaries.py IO_FORBIDDEN_SOURCE_PATTERNS now carries concrete regex entries for all six previously-missing tags (local_path_heuristics, storage_schema, http_runtime, cli_surface, catalog_persistence, transport), confirmed via diff e3929e597..3b22fe25d. Ran .just/tests/test_lint_boundaries.py::test_every_declared_io_forbidden_tag_has_source_pattern_mapping directly at this SHA -- 1 passed. Also independently re-ran the full `just lint` (python3 .just/run_lint.py all) at this SHA -- all 26 named checks passed. PR #838 CI confirmed green 9/9 (Test ubuntu/macos/windows, Just lint ubuntu/macos/windows, Clippy, Format check, Classify CI scope) via gh pr checks 838 --watch." ;
